cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you mention or build on FocusFlow, please cite it as below."
title: "FocusFlow — Deep Focus & App Blocker for Windows"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TBTechs"
    website: "https://tbtechs.pages.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TITANICBHAI/FocusFlow-PC"
url: "https://focusflowpc.pages.dev/"
license: GPL-2.0-only
abstract: >-
  FocusFlow is a free, open-source app blocker, website blocker and focus timer
  for Windows 10 and 11. It force-closes distracting apps, blocks websites
  through the hosts file, and can lock the desktop with a PIN-protected kiosk
  mode called Focus Launcher. All data stays on the user's PC.
keywords:
  - app blocker
  - website blocker
  - focus timer
  - pomodoro
  - productivity
  - windows
  - kotlin
  - compose multiplatform
